WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Start PCRC on Windows, compare the pairing codes, and keep the selected computer online.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Open Customize > Connectors, choose Add > Add custom connector, and enter the PCRC server URL.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Choose OAuth and Sign in now. Sign in to the account that owns the computer.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
+ > Connectors > PC Remote Commander. Try a read-only request and check the result.
